{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/pulls/5226","id":4275059765,"node_id":"PR_kwDOGiE5WM7-0Dw1","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5226","diff_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5226.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5226.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/5226","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/pulls/5226/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/pulls/5226/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/5226/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/statuses/980a57ce5b647dc3965b56735720b73ac86765d4","number":5226,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(pretty-json): support structured JSON content-types (+json)","user":{"login":"adityajha77","id":178451044,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqLyZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178451044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityajha77","html_url":"https://github.com/adityajha77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityajha77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityajha77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityajha77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityajha77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityajha77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityajha77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityajha77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityajha77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityajha77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Summary\r\n\r\nEnhances Hono's built-in `prettyJSON` middleware to:\r\n1. **Support Structured JSON Content-Types**: Recognize responses with `+json` media type suffixes (e.g. `application/problem+json`, `application/vnd.api+json`, `application/ld+json`, `application/geo+json`, `application/hal+json`) in addition to standard `application/json`.\r\n2. **Support Custom JSON Replacer**: Add an optional `replacer` function in `PrettyOptions` to allow custom formatting, value transformations, and key filtering during JSON stringification.\r\n\r\n### Author Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Add tests\r\n- [x] Run tests\r\n- [x] `bun run format:fix && bun run lint:fix` to format the code\r\n- [x] Add TSDoc/JSDoc to document the code\r\n\r\n### Changes Made\r\n\r\n- **`src/middleware/pretty-json/index.ts`**:\r\n  - Updated `Content-Type` matching to support structured JSON subtypes via `/^application\\/(?:[a-z0-9._-]+\\+)?json/i`.\r\n  - Added optional `replacer` option to `PrettyOptions`.\r\n  - Passed `options?.replacer` into `JSON.stringify(obj, options?.replacer, options?.space ?? 2)`.\r\n- **`src/middleware/pretty-json/index.test.ts`**:\r\n  - Added unit test verifying structured JSON response formatting (`application/problem+json` and `application/vnd.api+json`).\r\n  - Added unit test verifying custom `replacer` function behavior.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-13T21:26:58Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T10:31:21Z","closed_at":"2026-08-18T10:22:57Z","merged_at":"2026-08-18T10:22:57Z","merge_commit_sha":"5ad469a888f3944ae3e5d993621612d799f1e96c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"adityajha77:feat/pretty-json-enhancements","ref":"feat/pretty-json-enhancements","repo":{"id":1333524991,"node_id":"R_kgDOT3v5_w","name":"hono","full_name":"adityajha77/hono","owner":{"login":"adityajha77","id":178451044,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqLyZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178451044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adityajha77","html_url":"https://github.com/adi